From: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>
Subject: [PATCH v2] ALSA: 6fire: Use standard printk helpers

Convert with dev_err() and co from snd_printk(), etc.

Signed-off-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>
---
